	"data": "Mirrorworlds — Technological Parallel Realities\n\nType: Foundational Concept\nStatus: Original capstone work (2022), still the philosophical foundation for Room 2.0\nOrigin: Designing Reality capstone project\n\nCore Idea\nThe world is becoming digitized. Mirrorworlds are digital layers on top of base reality — themes, effects, virtual objects, and simulations that blend seamlessly with the physical world. The key metaphor: it's like a volume knob. All the way down is base reality, all the way up is…",
